cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: refdata-flow
abstract: >-
  A reproducible, automated workflow for downloading bioinformatics reference
  datasets (genome FASTA and gene annotation GTF) for multiple species and
  cataloguing them in a refgenie vault. Combines an interactive resolver for
  turning generic queries into exact assemblies, a Nextflow pipeline that runs
  the downloads in parallel via genomepy, and a post-processing step that
  registers the results in refgenie with human-readable aliases.
type: software
authors:
